  "If your dose column is headed “units”": "如果你的剂量列标题是“units”（单位）",
  "<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/dozify/id6764325653?pt=128799689&ct=web-glapp-alternative-en&mt=8\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Download on the App Store</a>": "<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/dozify/id6764325653?pt=128799689&ct=web-glapp-alternative-en&mt=8\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">在 App Store 下载</a>",
  "If you can get a CSV of your Glapp data, Dozify can read it. You see how many records it found, and which columns it read, before anything is written. Free, and Dozify does not upload the file.": "如果你能拿到 Glapp 数据的 CSV，Dozify 就能读取。在写入任何内容之前，你可以看到它找到了多少条记录、读取了哪些列。免费，而且 Dozify 不会上传该文件。",
  "The columns Dozify looks for in a Glapp CSV": "Dozify 在 Glapp CSV 中查找的列",
  "Not every format has been tested with a real export; the preview shows what was read before anything is written. Open your CSV and compare the header row. Dozify matches a column by any of these names, and it does not mind capitalisation or a unit written in brackets. Anything it cannot place is listed on the preview screen by name, so you can see what was left out rather than wondering.": "并非每种格式都用真实的导出文件测试过；预览会在写入任何内容之前显示读取到的内容。打开你的 CSV，对照表头行。Dozify 会按以下任一名称匹配列，不区分大小写，也不在意括号里写的单位。任何无法对应的列都会在预览界面上按名称列出，让你清楚看到哪些被略过，而不必猜测。",
  "Those rows are listed for you instead of being converted. A unit is a volume on a syringe, and how many milligrams sit in it depends on the concentration of your vial — a number the file does not carry. Writing them into a milligram field would record the wrong dose without anything downstream questioning it, so Dozify lists them as skipped; you can log those doses by hand in the amount your prescriber uses. <a href=\"/en/articles/units-vs-milligrams\">Why there is no one conversion →</a>": "这些行会列出来给你看，而不是被换算。一个单位是注射器上的一段体积，其中有多少毫克取决于你药瓶的浓度——而文件里并没有这个数字。把它们写进毫克字段，会记录一个错误的剂量，而后续没有任何环节会提出质疑，所以 Dozify 会把它们列为已跳过；你可以按处方医生使用的剂量单位手动记录这些剂量。<a href=\"/en/articles/units-vs-milligrams\">为什么没有统一的换算 →</a>",
  "Dozify is a tracking tool, not a medical device. It does not recommend doses and does not provide medical advice. Glapp is a trademark of its owner and is named here only to identify the app your data may come from; Dozify is not affiliated with Glapp and this page is not endorsed by them. Ozempic®, Wegovy®, Mounjaro®, Saxenda®, Zepbound®, Trulicity®, Victoza® and Rybelsus® are trademarks of their respective owners; Dozify is not affiliated with these companies.": "Dozify 是一款记录工具，不是医疗器械。它不推荐剂量，也不提供医疗建议。Glapp 是其所有者的商标，在此提及仅为指明你的数据可能来自的应用；Dozify 与 Glapp 没有关联，本页也未获得其认可。Ozempic®、Wegovy®、Mounjaro®、Saxenda®、Zepbound®、Trulicity®、Victoza® 和 Rybelsus® 是其各自所有者的商标；Dozify 与这些公司没有关联。"
